    "title": "Educational & Accuracy Disclaimer",
    "text": "This calculator provides financial estimates based on the Income Tax Ordinance 2001 and schedules enacted under Finance Act 2024. Final tax liability, advance tax adjustments, and refundable credits are subject to official assessment upon filing your annual return on the FBR Iris portal. For specialized corporate remuneration, consult a chartered accountant or registered tax practitioner."
